 S~S References to stakeholder goals satisfied by this artifact should name the stakeholder.

    Example: With respect to the relevant project documents used as reference.

    * Reviewer, the changes made today in the interrupt handler were based on:
      * Software Architecture Document v1.3b
      * Hardware Architecture Document v2.0g

    Example: With respect to a software developer with no experience.

    * Newbies: a full review of this version requires that you download it and do a full rebuild.
      (this is an explicit direction to a new developer, just a helpful reminder)

    * HW team: please make sure each developer receives a modified board by Wednesday end of day.
      (this is an implicit direction to a new developer that may show if they are paying attention)

    * yadda yadda blahblah   make it easy to dismiss/hightlight the comment if it does not apply

    * Curtis said blahblah   make it easy to dismiss/highlight the comment based on the commenter

